# === Agent-customization config — committed deliberately (portable, no secrets) ===
# The blanket *.json rule (top of file) swallows these. They use ${workspaceFolder}
# and carry NO secrets, so re-include them (last match wins) — versioning the MCP
# wiring + VS Code prompt files means a fresh clone gets them. See
# doc/AGENT_CUSTOMIZATION_PLAN.md.
# NOTE on what stays LOCAL by this repo's convention: the whole .claude/ tree
# (settings, rules, skills, agents) and .vscode/settings.json are ignored above.
# Root AGENTS.md and CLAUDE.md are portable project guidance and stay tracked.
!.vscode/mcp.json
!.mcp.json
# portable VS Code prompt files (ported .claude/commands) — no secrets.
!.github/prompts/
!.github/prompts/*.md

# Generated logs
pipeline.log
*.log
# Machine-local hook and evaluation telemetry. Keep only the directory marker so
# fresh clones can create their own append-only records.
/logs/*
!/logs/.gitkeep
# Cookieless page-view counter — runtime, ephemeral, grows per page load.
logs/page_views.jsonl
# Per-session token/turn telemetry from the SessionEnd hook — per-machine, append-only.
logs/session_token_ledger.jsonl
# Derived FTS5 content index behind search_project — rebuilt incrementally on demand.
.cache/

