# siting plausibility-gate + designation layer data (curated landmarks, OSM/ArcGIS caches)
data/silver/parquet/planning_layers/
doc/PLAN_ACP_GEOMETRY_AND_PRECEDENT.md
data/silver/parquet/planning_acp_cases.parquet
# precedent FTS over the inspector-report corpus (2026-07-26, Rahard) — engine IP; the
